# The single home of the fixture's image pins. One NAME=reference per line.
# The tags are what `supabase services` reports for the locked CLI (the PG15 tag with
# SUPABASE_DB_MAJOR_VERSION=15). The digests are the multi-platform index digests from
# `docker buildx imagetools inspect`, read 2026-11-26. The supabase/* images are pulled from
# ghcr.io/supabase; STOCK_PG17 from Docker Hub (the official image, used by the oracle later).
